  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2.4. Increased capacity Member States to apply sectoral international labour standards, codes of practice and guidelines</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Maldives - Ministry of Transport has reviewed and modified the Seafarer Identity Document (SID) in accordance with C108 - Seafarers&apos; Identity Documents Convention, 1958 (No. 108) and the ILO SID-002 standard. ILO has provided technical inputs for the officials from the Ministry of Economic Development and the Ministry of Transport and facilitated consultations with national stakeholders to review the prototype SIDs for compliance with ILO standards.</narrative>
   </description>
